  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communities of Hope: Intra and Interfaith Harmony for Sustainable Peace (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is that faith communities are more inclusive, cohesive, peaceful, and enjoy their rights with dignity. The project actively contributes to enhancing inclusive and gender-sensitive peacebuilding community structures, specifically designed to address sensitive conflict issues that may arise among faith communities.</narrative>
  </description>
